  "created": "2025-06-12T19:07:24.93Z",
  "description": "This package provides types for communicating with PLCs via libplctag.NET (https://www.nuget.org/packages/libplctag). Plug-ins that need to communicate with PLCs should reference this package and then use libplctag.NET to perform their PLC communication. This will ensure that a shared instance of libplctag is used for all PLC communication, which allows libplctag to optimize requests across the entire application and all active plug-ins.\n\nThis package also includes types that provide a thin layer over libplctag.NET to facilitate unit testing abstractions.",
